"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/18638.patch","merged_at":"2016-05-31T07:01:16Z"},"body":"When calling `findTemplateBuilder(context, currentFieldName, \"text\", null)`,\nelasticsearch ignores all templates that have a `match_mapping_type` set since\nno dynamic type is provided (the last parameter, which is null in that case).\nSo this should only be called _last_. Otherwise, if a path-based template\nmatches, it will have precedence over all type-based templates.\n\nCloses #18625\nCloses #2401\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/18638/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/18638/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]